# ONI — Cursor Operating Rules

## Read First

Before any task — read:
1. `AI_RULES.md` — behavioral constraints
2. `ARCHITECTURE.md` — section/system ownership
3. `FOLDER_MAP.md` — canonical repo structure (current state only)

`ROADMAP.md` = future intent. Do NOT implement roadmap items unless explicitly requested.
`_archive_graveyard/ONI_MASTER_SYSTEM.md` = archived bootstrap template. Do NOT treat as active implementation guide.

